OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder of
OL,4,Afather-of-three
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with the murder
OL,7,Fof a father of three who was found in a
OL,8,Fblock of flats.
OL,10,FBoguslaw Walczyk, 45, of The Foyer,
OL,11,FStoke Road, Slough, was charged with
OL,12,Fthe murder of Marcin Jankowski.
OL,14,FThe 48-year-old, from Slough, was found
OL,15,Fdead at The Foyer in Stoke Road on 24
OL,16,FSeptember. A post-mortem examination
OL,17,Findicated his death was the result of
OL,18,Fblunt force trauma, Thames Valley
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
